# 🔵 **EXAMPLE — Upstream Jenkinsfile (Correct Location)**

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {

        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                echo "Upstream build running..."
            }
        }

        stage('Test') {
            steps {
                echo "Running tests..."
            }
        }

        // 👉 PUT IT HERE — BEFORE triggering downstream
        stage('Trigger Downstream Job') {
            steps {
                script {

                    // THIS TRIGGERS DOWNSTREAM SAFELY
                    passUserToDownstream("Common-Framework/downstream-job-testing")

                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

